00:01:44.670 --> 00:01:46.580
The Inside Story!

00:01:44.670 --> 00:01:46.580
A Drillmaster for the Swine!!

00:01:47.750 --> 00:01:49.210
Ma'am, take a look.

00:01:49.210 --> 00:01:50.420
It's Oinky Doink.

00:01:50.420 --> 00:01:51.420
What about 'em?

00:01:51.420 --> 00:01:53.250
I hear Ranko Mannen joined them recently.

00:01:53.250 --> 00:01:56.170
Huh? The one who got busted fifteen years ago?

00:01:56.170 --> 00:01:58.000
She's back in Akiba?

00:01:58.000 --> 00:02:00.250
Yes, as a novice maid.

00:02:00.540 --> 00:02:04.460
They've been going 'round crushing places
ever since she joined.

00:02:04.830 --> 00:02:06.710
A new warmonger, huh?

00:02:14.830 --> 00:02:16.500
We're all created creatures!

00:02:16.830 --> 00:02:17.830
Listen up!

00:02:17.830 --> 00:02:20.540
Tell me what the Creatureland Group's purpose is.

00:02:20.540 --> 00:02:21.750
To unify Akiba, Boss!

00:02:21.750 --> 00:02:22.580
...Boss!
To unify Akiba, Boss!

00:02:22.580 --> 00:02:24.540
The following three cafes, get up here!

00:02:24.920 --> 00:02:26.420
Foxy Coaxy Vixen Cafe!

00:02:26.420 --> 00:02:27.460
Yes!

00:02:27.460 --> 00:02:28.880
The Dutiful Maidog!

00:02:28.880 --> 00:02:29.880
Yes!

00:02:29.880 --> 00:02:31.130
Oinky Doink Cafe!

00:02:31.420 --> 00:02:32.630
R-right!

00:02:34.460 --> 00:02:37.830
There are three important attributes
every maid in our group should have!

00:02:38.080 --> 00:02:40.750
One is the ability to fight.

00:02:40.750 --> 00:02:42.420
Aw, thanks...

00:02:42.920 --> 00:02:45.750
One is the ability to make money.

00:02:45.750 --> 00:02:47.250
I'm honored.

00:02:47.790 --> 00:02:50.790
And most important of all...

00:02:53.420 --> 00:02:55.040
Wh-why?

00:02:55.040 --> 00:02:59.210
Did you think we wouldn't notice
that you were embezzling sweets money?

00:03:03.290 --> 00:03:05.290
Allow me to take the fall for this!

00:03:06.040 --> 00:03:08.170
The most important thing...

00:03:10.210 --> 00:03:14.250
That is, loyalty toward the group.

00:03:14.830 --> 00:03:19.500
In order to enforce these three attributes,
we will be sending drillmasters to each cafe!

00:03:19.580 --> 00:03:21.250
Oinky Doink Cafe

00:03:20.250 --> 00:03:21.250
Okay, hogheads!

00:03:21.710 --> 00:03:24.210
Do you know what this cafe needs?!

00:03:24.210 --> 00:03:25.210
Vibes?

00:03:25.210 --> 00:03:26.210
Slyness.

00:03:26.210 --> 00:03:27.630
Kindness, maybe?

00:03:27.630 --> 00:03:28.960
A steadfast resolve.

00:03:28.960 --> 00:03:30.790
A capable chief?

00:03:30.790 --> 00:03:33.250
It's our recent lack of maid-like activities!

00:03:35.000 --> 00:03:36.630
<i>I-it's true!</i>

00:03:36.630 --> 00:03:40.500
<i>I've hardly done anything maid-like
since I've come to Akiba!</i>

00:03:40.750 --> 00:03:43.830
So the group is going to send us a drillmaster.

00:03:43.830 --> 00:03:45.040
For real?!

00:03:45.040 --> 00:03:47.290
Uh? What's a drillmaster?

00:03:49.080 --> 00:03:51.380
A specialist in training maids.

00:03:52.630 --> 00:03:56.880
They say most maids are crushed
under their hellish training.

00:03:58.330 --> 00:04:00.170
Cr-crushed?

00:04:00.380 --> 00:04:02.830
Once the drillmaster gets here,
we're gonna try real hard!

00:04:02.830 --> 00:04:04.380
We should always try hard.

00:04:04.960 --> 00:04:05.710
Oinky Doink Cafe

00:04:05.710 --> 00:04:06.830
Oinky Doink Cafe

00:04:05.710 --> 00:04:06.830
The Day Before Training

00:04:08.500 --> 00:04:10.460
Welcome home to the pigsty!
So I'm telling you...

00:04:12.380 --> 00:04:15.500
Your masters are supposed to come home to a pigsty?

00:04:16.630 --> 00:04:19.250
Uh well, this is just part of our theme...

00:04:19.250 --> 00:04:21.920
It's a maid cafe, but it's also a pigsty?

00:04:21.920 --> 00:04:23.130
So what?

00:04:23.130 --> 00:04:25.290
Uh, what?

00:04:26.210 --> 00:04:28.500
I'm Sano, the dispatch from the group.

00:04:28.920 --> 00:04:30.580
Every one of you fails!

00:04:30.830 --> 00:04:33.880
The place is dirty, the decorations are half-assed,

00:04:33.880 --> 00:04:35.630
you're over-reliant on your star employee

00:04:35.630 --> 00:04:38.420
and even she gets away with stale service
thanks to her regulars.

00:04:38.790 --> 00:04:41.750
The rest of you are so empty-headed
you only know how to snort.

00:04:42.210 --> 00:04:44.580
Above all, you have no loyalty towards our group!

00:04:44.580 --> 00:04:46.790
You're the sorriest bunch of maids I've ever seen!

00:04:46.920 --> 00:04:51.580
CREATURELAND

00:04:47.670 --> 00:04:50.380
Go reeducate any useless maids.

00:04:50.380 --> 00:04:52.080
Ok-reature!

00:04:52.080 --> 00:04:54.790
Cut off any maids you deem hopeless!

00:04:54.790 --> 00:04:56.210
Ok-reature!

00:04:56.540 --> 00:04:59.210
I accept no failures in training our creatures.

00:05:01.380 --> 00:05:03.330
Remember your life depends on this.

00:05:03.330 --> 00:05:05.000
Ok-reature!

00:05:05.750 --> 00:05:08.130
Your training starts tomorrow!

00:05:08.130 --> 00:05:11.210
If you pass the test within a week,

00:05:11.210 --> 00:05:13.460
I'll report to the higher ups that you're not a problem.

00:05:13.460 --> 00:05:15.420
A test?

00:05:15.710 --> 00:05:18.880
Each of you will squeeze out
100,000 yen worth of sweets money.

00:05:19.130 --> 00:05:20.330
Y'hear that?!

00:05:20.330 --> 00:05:23.330
The benevolent Ms. Sano
is giving you one final chance.

00:05:23.330 --> 00:05:24.750
Get your heads in the game!

00:05:24.750 --> 00:05:25.580
Hey...

00:05:25.580 --> 00:05:26.580
Yes?

00:05:26.580 --> 00:05:28.040
We're cutting you off.

00:05:28.040 --> 00:05:29.250
The panda, too.

00:05:29.830 --> 00:05:31.210
W-wait, why?

00:05:31.460 --> 00:05:35.170
You two are a bad influence on the maids.

00:05:35.170 --> 00:05:36.580
You're both rotten apples...

00:05:36.580 --> 00:05:38.330
No, more like sickly pigs.

00:05:38.330 --> 00:05:40.960
Oh but, I'm a very healthy pig!

00:05:41.290 --> 00:05:43.250
I'm saying this out of kindness.

00:05:43.250 --> 00:05:46.130
Or would you rather we disown you completely?

00:05:46.130 --> 00:05:47.710
A-anything but that!

00:05:47.710 --> 00:05:48.920
Then get out.

00:05:48.920 --> 00:05:49.920
Yes, ma'am.

00:05:54.130 --> 00:05:55.500
Chief...

00:05:55.500 --> 00:05:59.500
Starting today, you will treat me as if
I'm the Creatureland Group itself.

00:05:59.880 --> 00:06:01.670
Wakeup is at 5:00 a.m. tomorrow!

00:06:01.670 --> 00:06:02.880
That's all!

00:06:04.580 --> 00:06:06.540
Day One of Training

00:06:07.710 --> 00:06:09.920
Nagomi, it's time to get up.

00:06:10.380 --> 00:06:11.580
Hmm?

00:06:11.580 --> 00:06:14.210
Aw come on, I'm not that cute...

00:06:14.670 --> 00:06:15.880
Excuse me for this.

00:06:19.290 --> 00:06:20.790
It's time to get up.

00:06:20.790 --> 00:06:22.630
Uh, right.

00:06:23.500 --> 00:06:25.080
Welcome home!

00:06:23.500 --> 00:06:25.080
5:30 A.M. ~ Morning Assembly

00:06:25.290 --> 00:06:26.130
What?

00:06:26.130 --> 00:06:27.710
Welcome home!

00:06:27.710 --> 00:06:29.040
I can't hear you!

00:06:29.040 --> 00:06:30.460
Welcome home!

00:06:30.460 --> 00:06:31.880
I said, I can't hear you!

00:06:33.170 --> 00:06:35.330
7:00 A.M. ~ Job Training

00:06:33.920 --> 00:06:35.330
Totally out of sync.

00:06:35.580 --> 00:06:37.040
Do it again!

00:06:37.040 --> 00:06:38.040
Right!

00:06:38.040 --> 00:06:39.540
Answer, "Ok-reature!"

00:06:39.540 --> 00:06:41.000
Ok-reature!

00:06:41.330 --> 00:06:43.290
Um, I'm done drawing.

00:06:44.040 --> 00:06:45.540
What the heck is this?

00:06:45.670 --> 00:06:47.250
A...a kitty cat.

00:06:48.080 --> 00:06:49.460
Again!

00:06:49.460 --> 00:06:50.790
What a waste!

00:06:50.790 --> 00:06:52.920
If you think so, draw it properly!

00:06:52.920 --> 00:06:55.040
Think of the poor omelet!

00:06:55.790 --> 00:06:57.500
12:00 P.M. ~ Cafe Opens

00:06:56.130 --> 00:06:57.500
Welcome home!

00:06:58.170 --> 00:06:59.830
One Oinky Doink drink combo!

00:06:59.830 --> 00:07:01.250
Thanks, oinky doink!

00:07:01.250 --> 00:07:02.540
Thanks, oinky doink!

00:07:03.580 --> 00:07:04.580
Hey!

00:07:04.580 --> 00:07:05.420
Yes?

00:07:05.420 --> 00:07:07.290
Is your head full of cabbage?

00:07:07.290 --> 00:07:10.500
That much syrup can't be good for the master's health!

00:07:10.500 --> 00:07:11.710
Um...

00:07:11.710 --> 00:07:13.670
I'm saying, dilute it with more water!

00:07:13.670 --> 00:07:16.000
Uh, but the right amount based on cost...

00:07:16.000 --> 00:07:18.630
Is that all you care about, money, money, money?!

00:07:18.630 --> 00:07:19.630
Uh...

00:07:21.040 --> 00:07:23.380
Go ahead and comment on each other's shortcomings!

00:07:23.460 --> 00:07:27.500
9:00 P.M. ~ Performance Review Meeting

00:07:24.630 --> 00:07:26.380
You can't think of anything, can you?

00:07:26.380 --> 00:07:28.000
Because you weren't thinking at all!

00:07:28.130 --> 00:07:29.710
Then let me start off.

00:07:29.710 --> 00:07:30.710
Shiipon...

00:07:31.380 --> 00:07:33.000
What's with that makeup?

00:07:33.000 --> 00:07:35.330
It's not appropriate for the Creatureland Group!

00:07:35.330 --> 00:07:37.960
What?! Can't we at least wear makeup the way we-

00:07:37.960 --> 00:07:38.960
Moe!

00:07:39.330 --> 00:07:42.210
This cafe is part of the Creatureland Group.

00:07:42.210 --> 00:07:45.750
Unless you change who you are,
you won't be passing my test!

00:07:47.670 --> 00:07:50.000
0:00 A.M. ~ Teambuilding Exercise

00:07:50.290 --> 00:07:51.500
So sleepy!

00:07:51.500 --> 00:07:53.540
Do you think there's more?

00:07:55.580 --> 00:07:57.250
Wh-what's that?!

00:07:57.540 --> 00:08:00.710
I expect you to make a carving of this in a week!

00:08:00.580 --> 00:08:01.670
CREATURELAND

00:08:02.040 --> 00:08:04.170
Huh? How does that make any sense?!

00:08:04.540 --> 00:08:05.540
Moe!

00:08:05.920 --> 00:08:08.210
Get carving!
Or you'll get even less sleep!

00:08:11.420 --> 00:08:14.710
2:00 A.M. ~ Bedtime

00:08:15.130 --> 00:08:17.170
May I turn out the lights?

00:08:17.960 --> 00:08:22.000
Ranko, do you think being a maid is about
working for her parent group?

00:08:22.710 --> 00:08:24.540
That's also an important factor.

00:08:25.670 --> 00:08:26.880
Goodnight.

00:08:31.960 --> 00:08:33.670
So hungry...

00:08:34.670 --> 00:08:36.420
Oh hey, I've got bamboo leaves.

00:08:36.420 --> 00:08:37.630
Want 'em?

00:08:38.630 --> 00:08:40.000
Of course not.

00:08:40.000 --> 00:08:41.710
You're human, after all.

00:08:44.210 --> 00:08:45.920
Day Two of Training

00:08:47.750 --> 00:08:50.170
Do you realize it's morning assembly time?

00:08:50.790 --> 00:08:52.790
We're boycotting that.

00:08:53.080 --> 00:08:55.000
You want to leave the group?

00:08:55.250 --> 00:08:57.500
We just want a different drillmaster.

00:08:57.750 --> 00:09:01.040
It can't be efficient to be trained by
someone we don't agree with.

00:09:01.580 --> 00:09:04.210
I've been given full authority on this matter.

00:09:04.210 --> 00:09:05.960
Like we care!

00:09:05.960 --> 00:09:10.170
Boycott! Boycott! Boycott!

00:09:10.540 --> 00:09:11.790
Boycott! B-

00:09:12.500 --> 00:09:13.790
Please don't.

00:09:15.000 --> 00:09:16.210
I see.

00:09:16.210 --> 00:09:21.290
It was all for your own good,
but I suppose I took the wrong approach.

00:09:22.210 --> 00:09:23.580
I apologize.

00:09:24.040 --> 00:09:25.830
What's this all of a sudden?

00:09:25.830 --> 00:09:28.540
Let me talk to you individually before I go.

00:09:29.580 --> 00:09:32.790
If you still decide to kick me out, I'll comply.

00:09:33.830 --> 00:09:35.040
What do you think?

00:09:35.040 --> 00:09:37.580
Well, I guess talking's okay.

00:09:46.250 --> 00:09:48.710
I-I wonder what we're going to talk about?

00:09:53.380 --> 00:09:54.790
Nagomi!

00:09:54.790 --> 00:09:57.330
Take a look at the Creatureland Group building!

00:10:00.630 --> 00:10:02.790
CREATURELAND

00:10:03.040 --> 00:10:04.040
What do you think?

00:10:04.040 --> 00:10:05.790
I-it's really big.

00:10:06.080 --> 00:10:08.920
Do you know what the relationship is
between the group and its maids?

00:10:09.290 --> 00:10:11.080
N-not really...

00:10:11.290 --> 00:10:12.290
I see.

00:10:13.670 --> 00:10:14.670
Huh?

00:10:15.000 --> 00:10:16.000
What?

00:10:17.330 --> 00:10:20.710
Whaaaaaaaat?!

00:10:33.290 --> 00:10:35.080
N-no! I'm gonna die!

00:10:35.080 --> 00:10:36.290
Don't worry!

00:10:36.290 --> 00:10:38.420
I swear on my life I won't let go!

00:10:38.420 --> 00:10:40.750
No! Pull me up!

00:10:41.040 --> 00:10:45.000
These arms represent the relationship
between the group and its maids.

00:10:45.000 --> 00:10:46.210
Do you understand?!

00:10:46.210 --> 00:10:48.080
Yes, yes! I do understand!

00:10:48.080 --> 00:10:49.540
That's not how you answer!

00:10:49.540 --> 00:10:50.830
Okay! Okay! Okay!

00:10:50.830 --> 00:10:55.250
Ok-reature! Creature!

00:11:00.830 --> 00:11:02.040
Look at this!

00:11:02.630 --> 00:11:03.830
Do you see?

00:11:04.380 --> 00:11:05.710
Y-yes...

00:11:05.710 --> 00:11:07.380
What do you see?!

00:11:07.380 --> 00:11:10.880
I-I'b sowwy, I don't unberstand!

00:11:11.040 --> 00:11:12.920
This arm represents the group!

00:11:12.920 --> 00:11:15.710
It protects its maids, no matter how much it gets hurt.

00:11:18.790 --> 00:11:22.330
And maids squeeze out their sweets money.

00:11:23.000 --> 00:11:25.880
That's the kind of supportive relationship we share.

00:11:26.380 --> 00:11:29.330
R...'ight, 'ight!

00:11:29.330 --> 00:11:32.080
Of course! Of course it is!

00:11:38.080 --> 00:11:39.920
She tossed me off the roof.

00:11:40.250 --> 00:11:41.500
What the heck?

00:11:41.790 --> 00:11:43.080
She's crap, right?!

00:11:47.790 --> 00:11:49.080
Uh, what gives?

00:11:49.330 --> 00:11:53.380
You know, the stuff Ms. Sano says
is actually pretty decent.

00:11:53.380 --> 00:11:54.380
Huh?

00:11:54.380 --> 00:11:56.580
Maybe she's not a bad person.

00:11:56.920 --> 00:11:59.880
I kind of want to see what I can learn from her.

00:12:00.210 --> 00:12:03.250
Uh? We're gonna kick her out, right?

00:12:03.250 --> 00:12:06.580
What if we see how things go for like, a week or so?

00:12:06.580 --> 00:12:07.790
What?!

00:12:07.790 --> 00:12:09.170
What about Ranko?!

00:12:09.170 --> 00:12:11.580
I believe it's worth the experience.

00:12:12.580 --> 00:12:13.790
For real?

00:12:14.380 --> 00:12:15.580
There.

00:12:17.330 --> 00:12:20.000
The crunchy part of the chicken rice is in here!

00:12:20.000 --> 00:12:21.210
Score!

00:12:21.380 --> 00:12:22.960
Welcome home!

00:12:22.960 --> 00:12:24.540
Welcome home!

00:12:24.540 --> 00:12:26.080
Allow us to see you off!

00:12:24.540 --> 00:12:27.670
Day Three of Training

00:12:26.080 --> 00:12:27.670
Allow us to see you off!

00:12:27.830 --> 00:12:30.130
What's your work attitude going to be today?!

00:12:30.130 --> 00:12:32.330
We work with gratitude for our group!

