Yumechi!

00:12:34.920 --> 00:12:35.420
Yes!
Yumechi!

00:12:35.420 --> 00:12:35.750
Yumechi!

00:12:35.750 --> 00:12:36.420
Yes!
Yumechi!

00:12:36.420 --> 00:12:36.750
Yumechi!

00:12:36.750 --> 00:12:37.130
Yes!
Yumechi!

00:12:37.130 --> 00:12:39.920
Yumechi, good work on getting
100,000 yen worth of sweets money!

00:12:39.920 --> 00:12:41.290
Thank you, ma'am!

00:12:42.670 --> 00:12:43.880
Any remarks?

00:12:43.880 --> 00:12:46.580
I'm glad to have contributed to the Creatureland Group!

00:12:47.500 --> 00:12:48.710
Don't get complacent!

00:12:48.710 --> 00:12:49.920
Aren't you the star?!

00:12:49.920 --> 00:12:51.330
You can squeeze out more!

00:12:51.330 --> 00:12:52.710
I'll strain even harder!

00:12:52.830 --> 00:12:56.130
Good! All of you, go and serve your asses off!

00:12:56.130 --> 00:12:57.540
Ok-reature!

00:12:58.170 --> 00:12:59.170
Anyone else?!

00:12:59.170 --> 00:12:59.880
Yes!

00:12:59.880 --> 00:13:01.210
Okay, Zoya!

00:12:59.880 --> 00:13:04.750
9:00 P.M. ~ Performance Review Meeting

00:13:01.210 --> 00:13:03.080
Nagomi wasn't insistent enough

00:13:03.080 --> 00:13:06.000
and her master left without ordering anything!

00:13:06.290 --> 00:13:09.290
Zoya! Thank you so much for your comment!

00:13:09.460 --> 00:13:11.540
Instructor Sano, please do your worst!

00:13:12.040 --> 00:13:13.710
Ok-reature.

00:13:16.460 --> 00:13:17.460
Moe!

00:13:21.670 --> 00:13:22.920
Thank you very much!

00:13:22.920 --> 00:13:24.130
Anyone else?

00:13:26.130 --> 00:13:27.130
Huh?

00:13:27.460 --> 00:13:30.420
Shiipon played the hooky
during today's practice again!

00:13:30.420 --> 00:13:34.130
I don't feel any loyalty toward the group from Shiipon!

00:13:34.130 --> 00:13:35.920
Y-you guys...

00:13:36.080 --> 00:13:39.920
SHIIPON

00:13:36.420 --> 00:13:39.710
Moe! Moe! Moe!

00:13:40.170 --> 00:13:41.460
Isn't that better?

00:13:41.460 --> 00:13:44.540
Do you see the joy in working
for sweets money now?

00:13:44.540 --> 00:13:47.130
Starting tomorrow, let's do our best
for the sake of the group!

00:13:52.210 --> 00:13:56.630
Instructor Sano, thank you very much...

00:14:03.290 --> 00:14:04.540
What are you doing?

00:14:07.790 --> 00:14:10.250
A deserter! Get her!

00:14:15.630 --> 00:14:16.630
No way!

00:14:21.250 --> 00:14:22.710
Shiipon?

00:14:23.080 --> 00:14:24.920
Come on out!

00:14:24.920 --> 00:14:27.960
Everyone makes mistakes, you know!

00:14:28.830 --> 00:14:30.250
Shiipon?

00:14:32.130 --> 00:14:33.880
Open up! Open already, c'mon!

00:14:36.330 --> 00:14:37.330
Ranko?

00:14:45.960 --> 00:14:47.920
You can leave through here.

00:14:47.920 --> 00:14:49.750
Huh? I-I can go?

00:14:50.380 --> 00:14:52.170
If that is what you want.

00:14:53.330 --> 00:14:54.630
What about you?

00:14:54.630 --> 00:14:56.630
Are you going to stay here as a maid?

00:14:57.380 --> 00:15:00.130
All I care about is protecting this cafe.

00:15:01.380 --> 00:15:02.630
What about you, Shiipon?

00:15:03.290 --> 00:15:04.500
Well...

00:15:06.790 --> 00:15:08.880
<i>I just kind of fell into the business.
</i>Oh hey there, missy!

00:15:09.880 --> 00:15:12.330
<i>I never stuck with anything before this,</i>

00:15:14.080 --> 00:15:16.500
<i>so why was being a maid the one thing I kept up?</i>

00:15:19.500 --> 00:15:22.580
That's right, I had fun being a maid.

00:15:25.580 --> 00:15:26.790
I got it open.

00:15:26.960 --> 00:15:28.420
Oh, okay.

00:15:28.960 --> 00:15:30.630
<i>What else can I do?</i>

00:15:31.210 --> 00:15:34.170
<i>This isn't the Oinky Doink I know anymore.</i>

00:15:38.960 --> 00:15:39.960
Yo.

00:15:46.000 --> 00:15:47.210
Ranko...

00:15:47.670 --> 00:15:50.880
Actually, I wanna still be a maid.

00:15:53.210 --> 00:15:53.750
tureland

00:15:53.750 --> 00:15:56.130
tureland

00:15:53.750 --> 00:15:56.130
Day Four of Training

00:15:56.540 --> 00:15:57.540
Who?

00:15:57.540 --> 00:15:58.920
She's so cute!

00:16:00.630 --> 00:16:03.880
Starting today, I'll work my heart out
for the sake of the group!

00:16:05.040 --> 00:16:07.000
You look much cuter that way.

00:16:07.000 --> 00:16:08.250
It suits you well.

00:16:08.670 --> 00:16:09.960
Thank you very much!

00:16:10.630 --> 00:16:12.580
Now focus! Time for morning assembly!

00:16:12.580 --> 00:16:14.080
Ok-reature!

00:16:25.040 --> 00:16:27.000
Here's my 100,000 yen worth of sweets money!

00:16:32.080 --> 00:16:33.540
You sure made me wait!

00:16:35.500 --> 00:16:36.920
Ok-reature!

00:16:40.420 --> 00:16:42.420
Creatureland

00:16:42.420 --> 00:16:43.460
Creatureland

00:16:42.420 --> 00:16:43.460
Last Day of Training

00:16:43.460 --> 00:16:45.380
Last Day of Training

00:16:44.920 --> 00:16:47.880
Time to announce the final results of your training.

00:16:48.170 --> 00:16:49.170
Right!

00:16:49.170 --> 00:16:51.670
You're the sorriest bunch of maids I've ever seen!

00:16:51.670 --> 00:16:52.670
Right!

00:16:52.670 --> 00:16:53.960
Your heads are full of cabbage!

00:16:53.960 --> 00:16:55.500
Your sweets money is overdue!

00:16:55.500 --> 00:16:56.710
You always avoid work!

00:16:56.710 --> 00:16:58.630
That's the kind of despicable maids you are!

00:16:58.920 --> 00:16:59.920
Right!

00:17:00.880 --> 00:17:02.960
And yet, you're the best!

00:17:04.170 --> 00:17:05.830
Everyone passes!

00:17:06.880 --> 00:17:07.880
Right!

00:17:10.330 --> 00:17:12.000
Maids don't cry so easily!

00:17:12.290 --> 00:17:13.920
We're nod crwying!

00:17:14.790 --> 00:17:16.000
Listen up!

00:17:16.000 --> 00:17:19.630
From today, look at this result of your teamwork
to remind yourselves everyday

00:17:20.040 --> 00:17:22.790
that you're maids in the Creatureland Group!

00:17:24.040 --> 00:17:25.750
Ok-reature!

00:17:34.830 --> 00:17:36.170
Thank you...

00:17:37.130 --> 00:17:40.170
Thank you so much, Instructor Sano!

00:17:41.790 --> 00:17:44.920
Okachimachi, you're tired, aren't you?

00:17:45.250 --> 00:17:47.040
I am, too.

00:17:47.670 --> 00:17:50.250
I'm so very sleepy for some reason.

00:17:50.830 --> 00:17:52.250
I'm sleepy...

00:17:52.920 --> 00:17:56.210
But you know, did I really do anything wrong?

00:17:56.750 --> 00:18:00.630
I always get yelled at because they never earn enough!

00:18:01.580 --> 00:18:03.330
Now I'm getting annoyed!

00:18:05.920 --> 00:18:08.080
Time for you sickly pigs to come back!

00:18:08.710 --> 00:18:11.790
C'mon Master, please!

00:18:11.790 --> 00:18:14.500
I don't want to lose to Yumechi.

00:18:14.500 --> 00:18:16.130
Oh, uh, okay-

00:18:16.130 --> 00:18:18.330
Order a song from me.

00:18:18.540 --> 00:18:20.330
Huh? Where's Shiipon?

00:18:20.500 --> 00:18:23.290
She went for a stroll a little while ago.

00:18:23.290 --> 00:18:25.670
Yumechi, you don't look too good.

00:18:25.670 --> 00:18:27.290
No, I look fine.

00:18:27.750 --> 00:18:31.130
I've gotta cut back on stuff for the sweets money.

00:18:33.460 --> 00:18:36.040
Yo pricks! This ends right here!

00:18:36.290 --> 00:18:37.500
Chief?

00:18:37.500 --> 00:18:38.710
Shiipon?

00:18:38.710 --> 00:18:42.250
This cafe belongs to me!

00:18:42.250 --> 00:18:45.290
You'll regret you ever kicked me out!

00:18:46.790 --> 00:18:48.880
Hey! Where do you think you're going?!

00:18:49.500 --> 00:18:51.420
Please stop right there!

00:18:55.380 --> 00:18:56.630
I don't think so!

00:18:57.380 --> 00:18:58.580
Ranko?

00:19:02.880 --> 00:19:04.830
Ranko, thanks!

00:19:05.170 --> 00:19:07.000
Ranko, are you out of your mind?!

00:19:07.000 --> 00:19:08.330
Nagomi! Stop her!

00:19:08.330 --> 00:19:09.540
Right!

00:19:18.000 --> 00:19:19.210
Shiipon!

00:19:19.670 --> 00:19:20.880
She can't be serious!

00:19:20.880 --> 00:19:23.790
Creatureland

00:19:22.290 --> 00:19:23.830
Don't!

00:19:23.920 --> 00:19:25.420
Anything but that!

00:19:25.420 --> 00:19:28.460
That represents the bond between
us and Instructor Sano!

00:19:28.460 --> 00:19:31.290
Remember what we maids work for!

00:19:31.290 --> 00:19:32.670
It's for the sake of the group!

00:19:32.670 --> 00:19:34.170
Like heck it is!

00:19:36.920 --> 00:19:39.290
It's for the moments that are actually fun,

00:19:39.290 --> 00:19:42.250
even in this rotten town of Akiba!

00:19:44.500 --> 00:19:47.170
Listen up swine!

00:19:47.630 --> 00:19:51.460
Snap out of it and come baaaack!

00:19:52.000 --> 00:19:52.540
Creatureland

00:19:59.210 --> 00:20:03.210
NOOOOOO!

00:20:11.960 --> 00:20:15.080
A Few Days Later

00:20:15.080 --> 00:20:17.960
Oinky Doink Cafe

00:20:22.210 --> 00:20:23.540
Why is the panda here?

00:20:24.920 --> 00:20:26.380
Okachimachi!

00:20:26.380 --> 00:20:28.330
Here you go, bamboo leaves.

00:20:28.330 --> 00:20:31.420
Chief, you went and ate a parfait again, didn't you?

00:20:31.420 --> 00:20:33.080
Aww, I couldn't resist...

00:20:33.080 --> 00:20:34.540
I had one as well.

00:20:34.540 --> 00:20:35.750
You too, Zoya?!

00:20:35.750 --> 00:20:36.960
What happened?!

00:20:36.960 --> 00:20:38.250
They're back where they started.

00:20:38.500 --> 00:20:40.290
You coming in or leaving?

00:20:40.630 --> 00:20:42.130
Like, make up your mind.

00:20:43.080 --> 00:20:44.920
What are you all doing?!

00:20:44.920 --> 00:20:46.130
You know that won't do!

00:20:46.130 --> 00:20:47.500
Mistress!

00:20:47.500 --> 00:20:51.170
I'm very sorry, but there are other masters present, so-

00:20:51.170 --> 00:20:52.380
Silence!

00:20:52.380 --> 00:20:54.250
What's up with that hideous makeup?!

00:20:54.250 --> 00:20:56.040
It doesn't look good on you at all!

00:20:57.580 --> 00:21:00.790
My makeup's the bomb just the way it is.

00:21:01.170 --> 00:21:02.580
You don't get to decide.

00:21:02.710 --> 00:21:04.380
Ms. Sano, that's going too far.

00:21:04.380 --> 00:21:07.630
We've got masters in here so keep it down, okay?

00:21:08.000 --> 00:21:11.380
Oh, Ms. Sano, you can't go slapping Shiipon like that!

00:21:12.630 --> 00:21:15.250
<i>I-it's no good.
They're hopeless.</i>

00:21:15.920 --> 00:21:18.630
I accept no failures in training our creatures.

00:21:19.630 --> 00:21:21.670
Remember your life depends on this.

00:21:22.330 --> 00:21:24.750
<i>I'm responsible for this...</i>

00:21:25.130 --> 00:21:27.630
<i>I'll get cut off.
No, disowned even?!</i>

00:21:33.170 --> 00:21:35.710
Allow us to see you off, Mistress.

00:21:47.170 --> 00:21:49.790
The stop and flick of these strokes...

00:21:51.920 --> 00:21:53.130
Nagomi...

00:21:53.130 --> 00:21:54.170
Yes?

00:21:54.630 --> 00:21:56.500
You've gotten better at this.

00:21:57.460 --> 00:21:59.000
Thank you so much!

00:21:59.830 --> 00:22:01.880
<i>Nagomi Wahira, age seventeen!</i>

00:22:01.880 --> 00:22:04.040
<i>I'm having fun and learning loads as a maid!</i>

00:22:06.420 --> 00:22:09.580
Shiipon, being a maid sure is fun!

00:22:10.130 --> 00:22:11.500
Totally!

00:22:26.670 --> 00:22:31.580
Kyou mo ashita mo moe moe kyun

00:22:32.880 --> 00:22:38.000
Butagoya atari de moe moe kyun

00:22:38.880 --> 00:22:44.000
Sorega atai no ikizama sa

00:22:45.210 --> 00:22:53.790
Baka ni suru yatsa chi o miruze

00:22:53.790 --> 00:22:59.380
Mune o yogiru tamerai wa

00:22:59.920 --> 00:23:08.210
Hito no kokoro no nokoriga ka

00:23:08.830 --> 00:23:15.290
Ikirutomo haterutomo

00:23:15.540 --> 00:23:21.130
Onore no michi o tsuranuke

00:23:21.130 --> 00:23:27.500
Hikigane o hiki yagare

00:23:27.960 --> 00:23:33.830
Omae ga dare nanoka

00:23:34.040 --> 00:23:40.750
Itami de oshietokure
